 Table \ref{Variables} present a list of  the macroeconomic and bank-specific indicators used in this thesis. As previously mentioned, the selection of these indicators is based on the common practice in the NPL literature as well as their availability in the EBA Transparency Exercise database. 
  
  More detailed information regarding variable definitions, formulas, item IDs and sources is available in \hyperref[subsec:Descrip]{the appendix}. Furthermore, Figures \ref{VarDistr} and  \ref{Scatter} provide the distribution and the basic scatterplot on NPL ratios of each explanatory variable in the sample.

